    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i've tried the small things. the nature, the quiet moments... it doesn't work. it just makes the silence feel louder. i look at his things and i just feel this heavy pull to be where he is. it feels like the only place i'd ever be happy again is wherever he went. it’s like he took the light with him and left me here in the dark for no reason.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
